n>\n                        <span class=\"font-['Space_Mono']\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"brand identifier\">\n                            Vela™\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </aside>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-label=\"Operations data availability\" class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.12fr_1fr_1fr_1fr_1fr] border border-[#353a27] bg-[#0a0c07]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3\" data-name=\"runtime state indicators section\" style=\"clip-path:polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 12px), calc(100% - 12px) 100%, 0 100%)\">\n            <div class=\"border-r border-[#303719] px-4 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"runtime data status\">\n                <div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"section header\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-activity text-[#deff00]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"activity icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    Runtime data\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-[12px] leading-4 text-[#a2a98a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"runtime data description\">\n                    No UI/backend reader is connected. Values are unavailable.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-r border-[#303719] px-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"live account status\">\n                <div class=\"mb-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"section header\">\n                    Live account\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"font-['Space_Mono'] text-[11px] text-[#a2a98a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"account status text\">\n                    UNAVAILABLE\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#747c5e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"account description\">\n                    No account totals shown\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-r border-[#303719] px-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"positions status\">\n                <div class=\"mb-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"section header\">\n                    Positions\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"font-['Space_Mono'] text-[11px] text-[#a2a98a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"positions status text\">\n                    UNAVAILABLE\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#747c5e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-3\" data-name=\"positions description\">\n                    No position feed connected\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-r border-[#303719] px-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4\" data-name=\"decision events status\">\n                <div class=\"mb-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"section header\">\n                    Decision events\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"font-['Space_Mono'] text-[11px] text-[#a2a98a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"events status text\">\n                    WAITING FOR SOURCE\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#747c5e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-3\" data-name=\"events description\">\n                    Backend event reader absent\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"px-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-5\" data-name=\"risk reconciliation status\">\n                <div class=\"mb-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-5-1\" data-name=\"section header\">\n                    Risk / reconciliation\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"font-['Space_Mono'] text-[11px] text-[#a2a98a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-5-2\" data-name=\"risk status text\">\n                    UNAVAILABLE\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#747c5e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-5-3\" data-name=\"risk description\">\n                    Runtime state not connected\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <footer class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#24271b] pt-2 font-['Space_Mono'] text-[10px] text-[#858c70]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"footer section\">\n            <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"disclaimer text\">\n                Historical market data only · No live feed · No account or trade state is represented\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"kill switch status\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle text-[#deff00]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"alert icon\">\n                </i>\n                KILL_SWITCH baseline: absent (file not present at verified read)\n            </span>\n        </footer>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-10-04T12:15:48.791659+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-10-04T12:15:48.791659+00:00",
      "id": "var_e75b9660e975"
    },
    "var_d49bb82644aa": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "V1 · Prepare Run · Data contract",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 1540,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 2240
      },
      "html": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Chakra+Petch:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Cuprum:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@phosphor-icons/web@2.1.2/src/regular/style.css');\n</style>\n<main class=\"min-h-screen bg-black text-[#EDCC69] font-[Cuprum] px-8 py-6\">\n  <header class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#554D34] pb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\">\n      <div class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#EDCC69] font-[Chakra_Petch] text-lg\">B</div>\n      <div class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch] text-lg font-semibold tracking-wide\">BLACK JASMINE <span class=\"text-[#7B8A68]\">/ XAUUSD</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Primary\" class=\"flex items-center gap-7 font-[Chakra_Petch] text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">\n      <span>Operations</span><span>Training</span><span class=\"border-b-2 border-[#EC8022] pb-1 text-[#EDCC69]\">Prepare Run</span><span>Models / Evaluation</span><span>Risk / Settings</span>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-[Chakra_Petch] text-xs\">\n      <span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#554D34] px-3 py-1.5 text-[#EDCC69]\">DEMO</span>\n      <span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#F4A9A9]/60 px-3 py-1.5 text-[#F4A9A9]\">SUPERVISOR · unavailable</span>\n      <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#B5A56C]\"><span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-[#7B8A68]\"></span>KILL SWITCH · not present</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-8 py-7\">\n    <div>\n      <h1 class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch] text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Prepare run</h1>\n      <p class=\"mt-2 max-w-3xl text-base text-[#B5A56C]\">Prepare data, define the feature contract, resolve a real training command, and check launch dependencies.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l border-[#554D34] pl-5 text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">\n      <i class=\"ph ph-cpu text-xl text-[#EDCC69]\"></i><span>Device <b class=\"text-[#EDCC69]\">auto → CPU</b></span><span class=\"text-[#554D34]\">·</span><span>GPU unavailable</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_330px] gap-6 mb-6\" aria-label=\"Data preparation and dependencies\">\n    <div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-[#0D0A03] p-6\">\n      <div class=\"mb-5 flex items-start justify-between gap-4\">\n        <div><h2 class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch] text-2xl font-medium\">Data preparation</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Input source and train/validation boundary used to build a leak-free contract.</p></div>\n        <span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#7B8A68]/70 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-[#7B8A68]\">CSV exists</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.35fr_0.8fr_1fr] gap-4\">\n        <label class=\"block text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Data CSV <code class=\"rounded bg-[#554D34]/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-[#EDCC69]\">--data</code>\n          <span class=\"relative mt-2 block\"><select class=\"w-full appearance-none rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-4 py-3 pr-10 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\"><option>data/xauusd_h1.csv</option></select><i class=\"ph ph-caret-down pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-lg text-[#B5A56C]\"></i></span>\n          <span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[#7B8A68]\">Confirmed present · H1 historical bars</span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"block text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Train end <span class=\"text-[#EDCC69]\">--train-end</span>\n          <input value=\"2022-01-01\" class=\"mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-4 py-3 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\" />\n          <span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[#B5A56C]\">Validation begins after this boundary</span>\n        </label>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center border-l border-[#554D34] pl-5\">\n          <label class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-base\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"size-4 accent-[#EC8022]\" /><span>Macro / calendar features</span></label>\n          <p class=\"ml-7 mt-1 text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Optional · requires <code class=\"text-[#EDCC69]\">MACRO_CSV</code>. Calendar inputs use a one-bar causal lag.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-5 border-t border-[#554D34] pt-5\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch] text-lg\">Feature contract</h3>\n            <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Fit normalization on train rows only; validation rows do not enter the fit. Warm-up drop: 200 bars.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#F4A9A9]/60 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-[#F4A9A9]\">Not built for this run</span><button type=\"button\" disabled class=\"cursor-not-allowed rounded-full border border-[#554D34] px-4 py-2 text-sm text-[#7B7354]\">Build contract · unavailable</button></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-[0.55fr_0.55fr_1.15fr_1.55fr] items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black/50 px-4 py-3\">\n          <div><span class=\"block text-xs text-[#B5A56C]\">WINDOW</span><b class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch] text-lg\">64</b></div>\n          <div><span class=\"block text-xs text-[#B5A56C]\">N_FEATURES</span><b class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch] text-lg text-[#B5A56C]\">Pending</b></div>\n          <div><span class=\"block text-xs text-[#B5A56C]\">OBSERVATION DIMENSION</span><b class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch] text-lg\">window × n_features + 5</b></div>\n          <div class=\"border-l border-[#554D34] pl-4\"><span class=\"block text-xs text-[#B5A56C]\">CONTRACT HASH</span><b class=\"font-[Cuprum] text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Pending · generated from feature_contract.json</b></div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-[#B5A56C]\">The +5 account vector is [position, trade_pnl, bars_in_trade, drawdown, equity_ratio]. No contract hash is asserted before artifacts are written.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-[#0D0A03] p-5\">\n      <h2 class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch] text-xl\">Dependency order</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-5 space-y-0\">\n        <div class=\"flex gap-3 pb-5\"><span class=\"grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#7B8A68] text-sm text-[#7B8A68]\">1</span><div><b>CSV + split</b><p class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Source exists · boundary set</p></div></div>\n        <div class=\"ml-3 h-4 border-l border-[#554D34]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"flex gap-3 py-2\"><span class=\"grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#554D34] text-sm\">2</span><div><b>Feature contract</b><p class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Build before validation</p></div></div>\n        <div class=\"ml-3 h-4 border-l border-[#554D34]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"flex gap-3 py-2\"><span class=\"grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#554D34] text-sm\">3</span><div><b>Preset + CLI flags</b><p class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Script and arguments</p></div></div>\n        <div class=\"ml-3 h-4 border-l border-[#554D34]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"flex gap-3 pt-2\"><span class=\"grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#F4A9A9]/60 text-sm text-[#F4A9A9]\">4</span><div><b>Preflight → launch</b><p class=\"text-sm text-[#F4A9A9]\">Supervisor/API unavailable</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-5 border-t border-[#554D34] pt-4 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[#B5A56C]\">Leakage check</span><p class=\"mt-1 text-[#B5A56C]\">Not run · no prep job submitted</p></div>\n    </aside>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-[#0D0A03] p-6 mb-6\" aria-label=\"Model preset and CLI flags\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5 border-b border-[#554D34] pb-5\">\n      <div><h2 class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch] text-2xl\">Model preset & flags</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">These controls map to a verified training script. Preview only; no process is spawned.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><label for=\"preset\" class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Preset</label><span class=\"relative\"><select id=\"preset\" class=\"min-w-52 appearance-none rounded-full border border-[#EDCC69]/60 bg-black px-4 py-2.5 pr-10 font-[Chakra_Petch] text-[#EDCC69]\"><option selected>dreamer</option><option>transformer</option><option>ppo</option><option>ensemble</option><option>god-mode</option><option>ultimate-150</option><option>adversarial</option><option>meta-train</option></select><i class=\"ph ph-caret-down pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-lg text-[#EDCC69]\"></i></span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] gap-7 pt-5\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-4\">\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Steps <code class=\"rounded bg-[#554D34]/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-[#EDCC69]\">--steps</code><input value=\"100000\" class=\"mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-3 py-2.5 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\" /></label>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Prefill <code class=\"text-xs\">--prefill</code><input value=\"5000\" class=\"mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-3 py-2.5 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\" /></label>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Batch size <code class=\"text-xs\">--batch-size</code><input value=\"16\" class=\"mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-3 py-2.5 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\" /></label>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Train every <code class=\"text-xs\">--train-every</code><input value=\"4\" class=\"mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-3 py-2.5 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\" /></label>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Sequence length <code class=\"text-xs\">--seq-len</code><input value=\"64\" class=\"mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-3 py-2.5 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\" /></label>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Window <code class=\"text-xs\">--window</code><input value=\"64\" class=\"mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-3 py-2.5 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\" /></label>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Embed dim <code class=\"text-xs\">--embed-dim</code><input value=\"256\" class=\"mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-3 py-2.5 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\" /></label>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Hidden dim <code class=\"text-xs\">--hidden-dim</code><input value=\"512\" class=\"mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-3 py-2.5 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\" /></label>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Stoch dim <code class=\"text-xs\">--stoch-dim</code><input value=\"32\" class=\"mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-3 py-2.5 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\" /></label>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Num categories <code class=\"text-xs\">--num-categories</code><input value=\"32\" class=\"mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-3 py-2.5 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\" /></label>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Horizon <code class=\"text-xs\">--horizon</code><input value=\"15\" class=\"mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-3 py-2.5 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\" /></label>\n          <label class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Device <code class=\"text-xs\">--device</code><select class=\"mt-1.5 block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-3 py-2.5 text-base text-[#EDCC69]\"><option>auto → CPU</option><option>cpu</option></select></label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#554D34] pt-4\">\n          <label class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"mt-1 size-4 accent-[#EC8022]\" /><span><b class=\"text-base\">SL/TP model actions</b> <code class=\"ml-1 text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">--sl-tp-model</code><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Off by default · rules-based legacy 3-action environment</span></span></label>\n          <span class=\"text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Manifest mode: <b class=\"text-[#EDCC69]\">rules</b></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-3 rounded-2xl border border-[#F4A9A9]/50 bg-black/40 px-4 py-3\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[#F4A9A9]\"><i class=\"ph ph-warning-circle text-lg\"></i><b>When enabled, action space expands to 75 actions.</b></div>\n          <div class=\"mt-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\"><p>SL buckets · price fractions<br><b class=\"text-[#EDCC69]\">{0.005, 0.01, 0.02, 0.03, 0.05}</b></p><p>TP buckets · price fractions<br><b class=\"text-[#EDCC69]\">{0.005, 0.01, 0.02, 0.03, 0.05}</b></p></div>\n          <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-[#B5A56C]\">Composite action = direction (3) × SL (5) × TP (5). Artifact must record <code>sl_tp_mode: model</code> and <code>action_dim: 75</code>.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"border-l border-[#554D34] pl-6\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><div><h3 class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch] text-lg\">Resolved target</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Selected script for dreamer</p></div><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#554D34] px-3 py-1 text-sm\">Dreamer</span></div>\n        <code class=\"mt-3 block rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-4 py-3 text-sm text-[#EDCC69]\">train/train_dreamer.py</code>\n        <div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\"><span>Data</span><code class=\"text-right text-[#EDCC69]\">--data data/xauusd_h1.csv</code><span>Train end</span><code class=\"text-right text-[#EDCC69]\">--train-end 2022-01-01</code><span>Action mode</span><code class=\"text-right text-[#EDCC69]\">--sl-tp-model off</code></div>\n        <div class=\"mt-5 border-t border-[#554D34] pt-4\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch] text-base\">Preset → verified script</h3>\n          <div class=\"mt-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5 text-sm\"><div>dreamer</div><code class=\"text-[#B5A56C]\">train/train_dreamer.py</code><div>transformer</div><code class=\"text-[#B5A56C]\">train/train_transformer.py</code><div>ppo</div><code class=\"text-[#B5A56C]\">train/train_ppo.py</code><div>ensemble</div><code class=\"text-[#B5A56C]\">train/train_ensemble.py</code><div>god-mode</div><code class=\"text-[#B5A56C]\">train/train_god_mode.py</code><div>ultimate-150</div><code class=\"text-[#B5A56C]\">train/train_ultimate_150.py</code><div>adversarial</div><code class=\"text-[#B5A56C]\">train/train_adversarial.py</code><div>meta-train</div><code class=\"text-[#B5A56C]\">train/meta_train_dreamer.py</code></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mt-5 grid grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] gap-5 border-t border-[#554D34] pt-4\">\n      <div><label class=\"block text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Base manifest <span class=\"text-xs\">required for adversarial / meta-train</span><span class=\"relative mt-1.5 block\"><select class=\"w-full appearance-none rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-4 py-2.5 pr-10 text-[#B5A56C]\"><option>Select a compatible base manifest (not required for dreamer)</option><option>dreamer_20261003T230304213562Z · NOT PROMOTABLE · passed=false</option><option>dreamer_20261003T230535411560Z · NOT PROMOTABLE · passed=false</option><option>ppo_gold_v1 · NOT PROMOTABLE · passed=false</option></select><i class=\"ph ph-caret-down pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-lg text-[#B5A56C]\"></i></span></label></div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center rounded-xl border border-[#F4A9A9]/40 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\"><i class=\"ph ph-warning-circle mr-3 text-xl text-[#F4A9A9]\"></i><span>Staged pipelines require a compatible base manifest: version, model/contract files, contract hash, and <code>obs_dim == window*n_features+5</code> must be checked by the supervisor. Candidates shown have <b class=\"text-[#F4A9A9]\">passed=false</b>; none is promotable.</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_370px] gap-6\" aria-label=\"Preflight and training launch\">\n    <div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-[#0D0A03] p-6\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between\"><div><h2 class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch] text-2xl\">Preflight</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Local evidence is distinct from checks the server has not run.</p></div><span class=\"text-sm text-[#F4A9A9]\">Server-side validation · Not checked</span></div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8\">\n        <div class=\"divide-y divide-[#554D34]\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3\"><span>Data file exists · <code>data/xauusd_h1.csv</code></span><b class=\"shrink-0 text-[#7B8A68]\">Confirmed</b></div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3\"><span>Venv interpreter · <code>.venv</code></span><b class=\"shrink-0 text-[#7B8A68]\">Confirmed</b></div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3\"><span>Train-end range in source</span><b class=\"shrink-0 text-[#F4A9A9]\">Not checked</b></div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3\"><span>Feature contract + dimension match</span><b class=\"shrink-0 text-[#F4A9A9]\">Not checked</b></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"divide-y divide-[#554D34]\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3\"><span>CLI fields and ranges</span><b class=\"shrink-0 text-[#F4A9A9]\">Not checked</b></div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3\"><span>Free disk space (≥ 2 GB) + artifact path</span><b class=\"shrink-0 text-[#F4A9A9]\">Not checked</b></div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3\"><span>Single-job concurrency guard</span><b class=\"shrink-0 text-[#F4A9A9]\">Not checked</b></div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3\"><span>Base manifest compatibility, if staged</span><b class=\"shrink-0 text-[#F4A9A9]\">Not checked</b></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <aside class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-[#0D0A03] p-6\">\n      <h2 class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch] text-2xl\">Launch training</h2>\n      <label class=\"mt-4 block text-sm text-[#B5A56C]\">Run name <span class=\"text-[#554D34]\">--run-name</span><input class=\"mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black px-4 py-3 text-[#EDCC69]\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"Leave blank\" /></label>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-between border-y border-[#554D34] py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[#B5A56C]\">Resolved interpreter</span><code class=\"text-[#EDCC69]\">.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe</code></div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><h3 class=\"font-[Chakra_Petch]\">CLI preview</h3><span class=\"text-xs text-[#B5A56C]\">Not submitted</span></div><pre class=\"mt-2 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words rounded-xl border border-[#554D34] bg-black p-3 font-mono text-xs leading-5 text-[#B5A56C]\">.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe train/train_dreamer.py --data data/xauusd_h1.csv --train-end 2022-01-01 --steps 100000 --prefill 5000 --batch-size 16 --train-every 4 --seq-len 64 --window 64 --embed-dim 256 --hidden-dim 512 --stoch-dim 32 --num-categories 32 --horizon 15 --device auto</pre></div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#F4A9A9]/60 bg-[#F4A9A9]/5 p-4\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-[Chakra_Petch] text-[#F4A9A9]\"><i class=\"ph ph-prohibit text-xl\"></i><b>Supervisor/API unavailable</b></div>\n        <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#F4A9A9]\">Training launch cannot be submitted until the supervisor/API is available. This screen only previews a request.</p>\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"button\" disabled class=\"mt-4 w-full cursor-not-allowed rounded-full border border-[#554D34] bg-[#554D34] px-5 py-3 font-[Chakra_Petch] font-semibold text-black/55\">Launch training · unavailable</button>\n      <p class=\"mt-2 text-center text-xs text-[#B5A56C]\">No run name, job ID, or launched state has been created.</p>\n    </aside>\n  </section>\n  <footer class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#554D34] pt-4 text-xs text-[#B5A56C]\"><span>Host controls require the backend supervisor · frontend does not start processes directly</span><span>Evaluation follows via <code class=\"text-[#EDCC69]\">train/evaluate.py</code> · promotion gate remains evidence-based</span></footer>\n</main>",
