"metadata value 4\" style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',monospace\">\n                                125f7d33c4927cba\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                <article data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4\" data-name=\"evaluation record row 3\">\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[2.45fr_0.85fr_0.9fr_0.85fr_1.2fr_1.45fr] items-start gap-y-3 px-5 py-5\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"evaluation data summary section\">\n                        <div class=\"pr-5\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"model name and status group\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"model name title\">\n                                ppo_gold_v1\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#ADC698]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"model passing status container\">\n                                PPO · passed:\n                                <span class=\"text-[#EBA294]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"passing status value\">\n                                    false\n                                </span>\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-[#EBA294]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"metric value 1\" style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',monospace\">\n                            −3.2120\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 font-normal text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"metric explanation 1\" style=\"font-family:'Josefin Slab',serif\">\n                                ≥ 0.5 · fails\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-[#EBA294]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-3\" data-name=\"metric value 2\" style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',monospace\">\n                            74.776%\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 font-normal text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-3-1\" data-name=\"metric explanation 2\" style=\"font-family:'Josefin Slab',serif\">\n                                ≤ 20% · fails\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-lg font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-4\" data-name=\"metric value 3\" style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',monospace\">\n                            2,849\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 font-normal text-[12px] text-[#ADC698]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-4-1\" data-name=\"metric explanation 3\" style=\"font-family:'Josefin Slab',serif\">\n                                ≥ 20 · meets\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-[#EBA294]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-5\" data-name=\"metric value 4\" style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',monospace\">\n                            −74.7353%\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 font-normal text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-5-1\" data-name=\"metric explanation 4\" style=\"font-family:'Josefin Slab',serif\">\n                                > 0% · fails\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm font-normal text-[#ADC698]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-5-2\" data-name=\"benchmark comparison text\" style=\"font-family:'Josefin Slab',serif\">\n                                Buy & hold +136.4805%\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-6\" data-name=\"overall evaluation result container\">\n                            <div class=\"font-bold text-[#EBA294]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-6-1\" data-name=\"result status headline\">\n                                NOT PROMOTABLE\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-snug\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-1-6-2\" data-name=\"failure reason description\">\n                                Fails Sharpe, max drawdown and total return.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-4 border-t border-[#6A4D4B] bg-[#302427] px-5 py-4 text-sm\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"evaluation metadata section\">\n                        <div class=\"min-w-[220px] flex-[2]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"metadata group 1\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[#ADC698]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"metadata label 1\">\n                                Source file\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 break-all text-[12px] leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"metadata value 1\" style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',monospace\">\n                                artifacts/models/ppo_gold_v1/evaluation.json\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"min-w-[230px] flex-[1.5]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"metadata group 2\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[#ADC698]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"metadata label 2\">\n                                Evaluated at (UTC)\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"metadata value 2\" style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',monospace\">\n                                2026-09-30T16:52:44.487453+00:00\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"min-w-[350px] flex-[2.6]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"metadata group 3\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[#ADC698]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"metadata label 3\">\n                                Test window\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"metadata value 3\" style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',monospace\">\n                                2022-01-02T23:00:00.000000 → 2025-12-31T21:00:00.000000\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"min-w-[150px] flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-2-4\" data-name=\"metadata group 4\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[#ADC698]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-2-4-1\" data-name=\"metadata label 4\">\n                                Contract hash\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 break-all text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-4-2-4-2\" data-name=\"metadata value 4\" style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',monospace\">\n                                125f7d33c4927cba\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <footer class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-0 border border-[#6A4D4B] bg-[#2B171D] md:grid-cols-[1.3fr_2fr]\" data-kid=\"1-5\" data-name=\"footer section\">\n        <div class=\"border-b border-[#6A4D4B] px-5 py-4 md:border-b-0 md:border-r\" data-kid=\"1-5-1\" data-name=\"footer warning panel\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#EBA294]\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"warning headline group\">\n                <i class=\"bx bx-lock-alt text-xl\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"lock icon\">\n                </i>\n                <h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"warning headline title\">\n                    Production · No production manifest\n                </h2>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#D6E6CA]\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2\" data-name=\"warning explanation text\">\n                No live model activation. Live model-driven trading remains blocked.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"px-5 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-5-2\" data-name=\"footer reading guide section\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"reading guide title\">\n                Reading the archive\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#ADC698]\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-2\" data-name=\"reading guide explanation text\">\n                Strong partial metrics do not override a failed gate. Both Dreamer runs fail the minimum trade count. PPO fails Sharpe, drawdown and return, and trails its buy-and-hold benchmark. All three source evaluations record\n                <span class=\"text-[#EBA294]\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"highlighted status text\">\n                    passed: false\n                </span>\n                .\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</main>\n",
